== Kids' Track: Decide Together

Sit down with your child and go one group at a time. Hold up each item and ask the same two questions: "Do you play with this?" and "Would you like to give it to someone who will?" Let their answer stand, unless the item is broken or unsafe. Keep sessions short. Stop when attention runs out.

